<html lang=""en"">
<head>
  <meta charset=""utf-8"">
  <meta name=""viewport"" content=""width=device-width, initial-scale=1"">
  <title>Rider Privacy Notice and Consent</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light; --text: #11202f; --secondary: #5b6b7c; --muted: #8b9aaa; --accent: #f475d0; --wash: #fdecf8; --ink: #3d0a2c; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
    body { margin: 0; background: #fff; color: var(--secondary); font: 15px/1.6 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, ""Segoe UI"", Roboto, ""Helvetica Neue"", Arial, sans-serif; }
    main { width: 100%; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 18px 28px; }
    .hero { margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--accent); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--text); font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.3; }
    h2 { margin: 26px 0 8px; color: var(--text); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.35; }
    p, ul { margin: 0 0 13px; }
    ul { padding-left: 20px; }
    li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
    strong { color: var(--text); }
    .muted { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    a { color: #b63891; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
    .callout { margin-top: 24px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--wash); color: var(--ink); }
    .callout h2 { margin-top: 0; }
    @media (max-width: 380px) { main { padding: 16px 14px 24px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <header class=""hero"">
    <p class=""eyebrow"">Before you continue</p>
    <h1>Rider Privacy Notice cum Consent</h1>
    <p>Consent for collection of personal data under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act 2023.</p>
  </header>

  <section class=""card"" aria-labelledby=""purpose"">
    <h2 id=""purpose"">Purpose of data collection</h2>
    <p>To onboard riders on the platform of EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD to avail its services and to facilitate subsequent transactions.</p>
  </section>

  <section class=""card"" aria-labelledby=""details"">
    <h2 id=""details"">Types of data collected</h2>
    <p>EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD will collect the following personal data:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Identification information (PAN, name, and date of birth).</li>
      <li>One proof of address (Aadhaar, driving licence or another officially valid document).</li>
      <li>Contact information (email address and phone number).</li>
      <li>Financial information (bank details, upi details, or income statement), if applicable.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class=""card"" aria-labelledby=""sources"">
    <h2 id=""sources"">Sources of data collection</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>NSDL.</li>
      <li>Databases maintained by government, statutory or regulatory authorities.</li>
      <li>The onboarding entity or user.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class=""card"" aria-labelledby=""sharing"">
    <h2 id=""sharing"">Data sharing</h2>
    <p>EV SPARES INDIA PVT LTD is authorised to share data with statutory, regulatory and government authorities; service providers engaged for business and operational purposes; and parties involved in facilitating services provided by the company.</p>
  </section>

  <section class=""card"" aria-labelledby=""choice"">
    <h2 id=""choice"">Rights of the data principal</h2>
    <p>You may request correction, completion, updating and erasure of personal data processed with your consent, and withdraw consent at any time. To exercise these rights, contact the company at dpo@yogmaya.com.</p>
    <p>Notwithstanding a request to withdraw consent, the company may retain data for periods prescribed by applicable law and for transactions initiated before withdrawal. For a complaint or grievance, contact office@yogmaya.com. An unresolved complaint may be escalated to the Data Protection Board in accordance with applicable law.
  </section>

  
</main>
</body>
</html>",a671a6bbf8689beafa8177435179020930a51ba82fec9773529d614c70be4fef,2026-10-11 18:30:00,2026-10-17 21:40:22.998,,,2026-10-11 19:47:56.115
