e60147c1-7e21-4838-b140-c79b6b7b98c3,274978aa-19e9-4802-8791-05abe6244d9b,FLEET_MANAGER,FLEET_MANAGER,PRIVACY_POLICY,te,1.0.0,ఫ్లీట్ మేనేజర్ గోప్యతా విధానం,"<!DOCTYPE html>
