3ab3c4ba-c75b-4f01-b064-1af5d9527425,RIDER,RIDER,TERMS_AND_CONDITIONS,or,1.0.0,ରାଇଡର୍ ନିୟମ ଓ ସର୍ତ୍ତାବଳୀ,"<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang=""or"" dir=""ltr"">
<head><meta charset=""utf-8""><meta name=""viewport"" content=""width=device-width, initial-scale=1""><title>ରାଇଡର୍ ନିୟମ ଓ ସର୍ତ୍ତାବଳୀ</title><style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --text: #11202f;
      --text-secondary: #5b6b7c;
      --muted: #8b9aaa;
      --accent: #f475d0;
      --wash: #fdecf8;
      --ink: #3d0a2c;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

