452e1211-92de-4bb1-8e62-9cd21877371a,FLEET_MANAGER,FLEET_MANAGER,TERMS_AND_CONDITIONS,bn,1.0.0,ফ্লিট ম্যানেজারের শর্তাবলি,"<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang=""bn"">
<head><meta charset=""utf-8""><meta name=""viewport"" content=""width=device-width, initial-scale=1""><title>ফ্লিট ম্যানেজারের শর্তাবলি</title><style>
    :root { color-scheme: light; --text: #11202f; --secondary: #5b6b7c; --muted: #8b9aaa; --accent: #f475d0; --wash: #fdecf8; --ink: #3d0a2c; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
