974e38e2-162b-4470-8854-fbd1da5c66e9,FLEET_MANAGER,FLEET_MANAGER,PRIVACY_POLICY,gu,1.0.0,ફ્લીટ મેનેજર ગોપનીયતા નીતિ,"<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang=""gu"" dir=""ltr"">
<head><meta charset=""utf-8""><meta name=""viewport"" content=""width=device-width, initial-scale=1""><title>ફ્લીટ મેનેજર ગોપનીયતા નીતિ</title><style>
    :root { color-scheme: light; --text: #11202f; --secondary: #5b6b7c; --muted: #8b9aaa; --accent: #f475d0; --wash: #fdecf8; --ink: #3d0a2c; }
