IVE""}, ""ur"": {""name"": ""ایپ کا تعارف دکھائیں"", ""description"": ""لاگ اِن کرنے سے پہلے اختیاری تعارفی سلائیڈز دکھائیں۔"", ""translationStatus"": ""ACTIVE""}}, ""configuration"": {""version"": ""3"", ""appCodes"": [""RIDER""], ""translations"": {""en"": [{""key"": ""earn"", ""body"": ""Daily payouts, transparent incentives and a rental plan that fits how much you actually ride."", ""title"": ""Earn more,\nride cleaner"", ""highlights"": [""Same-day settlement"", ""No hidden deductions""]}, {""key"": ""vehicle"", ""body"": ""Live battery, range and health from the onboard IoT unit. Unlock and start your shift from the app."", ""title"": ""Your scooter,\nfully connected"", ""highlights"": [""Live telemetry"", ""One-tap start""]}, {""key"": ""support"", ""body"": ""Roadside assistance, service booking and a team lead who can see exactly what you see."", ""title"": ""Help that\nshows up"", ""highlights"": [""24x7 roadside help"", ""Service at your hub""]}]}, ""componentType"": ""INTRO_CAROUSEL""}}",916735fa23a573c3e74bfe72891e353a8dc800637dbfe93ddf286e5cd7b6465c,2026-10-15 19:55:31.283,2026-10-15 19:55:31.285
e0664949-14ac-474c-bec4-eacbc82608be,8dcf5927-9d2e-405f-8801-6071d804a09c,1,"{""id"": ""8dcf5927-9d2e-405f-8801-6071d804a09c"", ""code"": ""SHOW_AGREEMENT_E_SIGN"", ""name"": ""E-Sign the agreement"", ""step"": {""id"": ""902b669a-1bdf-4b7a-b714-a52240f9fe33"", ""code"": ""RIDER_AGREEMENT_ESIGN"", ""name"": ""Agreement & E-Sign"", ""order"": 6, ""parentId"": ""f713eb2f-c00a-4ab7-b9a0-dfc4cdbaf7f0"", ""parentCode"": ""RIDER_ONBOARDING"", ""description"": ""Presents the applicable rider agreement and manages electronic acceptance and e-signature."", ""translations"": {""as"": {""description"": ""প্ৰযোজ্য ৰাইডাৰ চুক্তি প্ৰদৰ্শন কৰা আৰু ইলেক্ট্ৰনিক গ্ৰহণযোগ্যতা তথা ই-স্বাক্ষৰ পৰিচালনা কৰা।"", ""displayName"": ""চুক্তি আৰু ই-স্বাক্ষৰ"", ""translationStatus"": ""ACTIVE""}, ""bn"": {""description"": ""প্রযোজ্য রাইডার চুক্তি দেখানো এবং ইলেকট্রনিক গ্রহণ ও ই-স্বাক্ষর পরিচালনা করা।"", ""displayName"": ""চুক্তি ও ই-স্বাক্ষর"", ""translationStatus"": ""ACTIVE""}, ""gu"": {""description"": ""લાગુ પડતો રાઇડર કરાર દર્શાવવો અને ઇલેક્ટ્રોનિક સ્વીકૃતિ તથા ઇ-સહીનું સંચાલન કરવું."", ""displayName"": ""કરાર અને ઇ-સહી"", ""translationStatus"": ""ACTIVE""}, ""hi"": {""description"": ""लागू राइडर समझौता दिखाना तथा उसकी इलेक्ट्रॉनिक स्वीकृति और ई-हस्ताक्षर का प्रबंधन करना।"", ""displayName"": ""अनुबंध और ई-हस्ताक्षर"", ""translationStatus"": ""ACTIVE""}, ""kn"": {""description"": ""ಅನ್ವಯಿಸುವ ರೈಡರ್ ಒಪ್ಪಂದವನ್ನು ಪ್ರದರ್ಶಿಸಿ, ಎಲೆಕ್ಟ್ರಾನಿಕ್ ಸ್ವೀಕೃತಿ ಮತ್ತು ಇ-ಸಹಿಯನ್ನು ನಿರ್ವಹಿಸುವುದು."", ""displayName"": ""ಒಪ್ಪಂದ ಮತ್ತು ಇ-ಸಹಿ"", ""translationStatus"": ""ACTIVE""}, ""ml"": {""description"": ""ബാധകമായ റൈഡർ കരാർ പ്രദർശിപ്പിക്കുകയും ഇലക്ട്രോണിക് അംഗീകാരവും ഇ-ഒപ്പും കൈകാര്യം ചെയ്യുകയും ചെയ്യുക."", ""displayName"": ""കരാറും ഇ-ഒപ്പും"", ""translationStatus"": ""ACTIVE""}, ""mr"": {""description"": ""लागू असलेला रायडर करार दाखवणे आणि त्याची इलेक्ट्रॉनिक स्वीकृती व ई-स्वाक्षरी व्यवस्थापित करणे."", ""displayName"": ""करार आणि ई-स्वाक्षरी"", ""translationStatus"": ""ACTIVE""}, ""or"": {""description"": ""ପ୍ରଯୋଜ୍ୟ